id:                     E3354
trigger_tool:           ld|cmake|make
phase:                  linking
error_signature:        undefined symbol: wxMutex::Lock|undefined symbol: wxAppConsole|wx-config: No such file or directory|libiconv_open
severity:               3
category:               portability, build-system, linking
match_keywords:         wxwidgets, wx-config, wxMutex, wxAppConsole, libiconv, OHOS
title:                  Published wxWidgets 3.2.10 base binary is unlinkable and its wx-config records a foreign prefix
root_cause:             The registry wxwidgets/3.2.10 OHOS binary's bin/wx-config is a symlink to the builder's Conan cache, and the script bakes that absolute prefix plus a CMake generator expression for zlib. The static base archive also omits thread and console-app objects, so a real consumer fails at link with wxMutex, wxThread, wxAppConsole and wxStackWalker. A rebuilt base then needs libiconv.
affected_scope:         Console or base-only consumers of the published wxwidgets/3.2.10 package on HarmonyOS PC, including VeraCrypt NOGUI.
verification_cmd:       ls -l "$WX_PREFIX/bin/wx-config"; "$WX_PREFIX/bin/wx-config" --cxxflags; nm -C "$WX_PREFIX/lib"/libwx_baseu*.a | grep -c wxMutex::Lock
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           rebuild-wx-base-in-consumer
rec_description:        Do not link the published base archive. Build wxWidgets 3.2.10 with wxUSE_GUI=OFF, wxUSE_THREADS=ON, sockets and net off, and point WX_CONFIG at a wrapper over that prefix. Link libiconv, zlib and expat, and stub musl's missing pthread_cancel.
rec_command:            cmake -DwxUSE_GUI=OFF -DwxUSE_THREADS=ON -DwxUSE_SOCKETS=OFF -DwxBUILD_TOOLKIT=gtk3
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               manual
fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      none
fallback_description:   There is no flag on the published package that adds the missing objects.
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:
forbid_1_pattern:       WX_CONFIG=.*/bin/wx-config
forbid_1_reason:        That path is a dangling symlink to the machine that created the binary.
forbid_1_consequence:   make reports wx-config: No such file or directory and then wx/wx.h is not found.
principles:
causes:
last_updated:               2026-10-19
authors:               iKalous_OscarP
doc_file:               doc/E3354.md
